      "description": "<p>The ghost ape beats their chest in a terrifying display. Creatures within 30 feet must succeed a DC 20 Will Saving Throw save or become Frightened 1 (or Frightened 2 on a critical failure). While a creature is frightened by this ability, it's Off-Guard to the ape. On a success, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>",
